# Lake build artifacts
.lake/
/.lake

# Archon state directory
.archon/

# Scratch probe files at the project root.
#
# Throwaway single-file experiments (axiom probes, goal inspection, tactic trials)
# that sessions create beside the library and delete when done. They are NOT part
# of the `AlgebraicJacobian` lib target, so nothing imports or elaborates them and
# a stale one is invisible to every build.
#
# They are ignored because the shared workspace index sweeps whatever sits in the
# tree into whichever commit lands next: a probe created and deleted inside one
# session can be committed by ANOTHER lane's integration commit, and then shows up
# forever afterwards as a phantom staged deletion (inbox `I-0611`). Ignoring the
# pattern is the only fix that does not depend on every session's discipline.
#
# Ported from the sibling project's `.gitignore`, which hardened these patterns on
# 2026-07-28 after a case-sensitive version let `probe_*.lean` through. If a probe
# earns a place in the library, move it under `AlgebraicJacobian/` and import it
# from `AlgebraicJacobian.lean` — do not rename it to dodge this pattern.
*Probe*.lean
*probe*.lean
/probe_*.lean
/scratch_*.lean
/Scratch_*.lean
